# Required by the project-root contract: 06_build/ is DISPOSABLE and must not be
# committed as truth (its contracts.md is the one exception). MISSING SINCE
# COMMISSION — the scaffold copied the stage contracts but no .gitignore, and
# 8 of 10 boards in this fleet have one. Without it the first policy_audit run
# leaves 06_build/policy_audit.md sitting untracked-and-committable.
#
# NOT ignored, deliberately: 01_docs/decisions/ and 02_parts/ — the least
# regenerable content in the repo, and a repo-wide pattern that swallowed them
# would be a defect.
06_build/*
!06_build/contracts.md

*.kicad_pcb-bak
*.kicad_sch-bak
*-backups/
_autosave-*
fp-info-cache
__pycache__/
*.kicad_prl

# tscircuit build cache + intermediate export
03_tscircuit/.tscircuit/
03_tscircuit/dist/
